WEBVTT

00:07:26.804 --> 00:07:30.978
You can't do science without making it logically consistent.

00:07:30.978 --> 00:07:34.788
And even down in grade school, things have changed.

00:07:34.788 --> 00:07:37.722
In 1910, they looked at the examinations

00:07:37.722 --> 00:07:41.542
that the state of Ohio gave to 14-year-olds,

00:07:41.542 --> 00:07:43.148
and they found that they were all

00:07:43.148 --> 00:07:46.583
for socially valued concrete information.

00:07:46.583 --> 00:07:47.914
They were things like,

00:07:47.914 --> 00:07:50.801
what are the capitals of the 44 or 45 states

00:07:50.801 --> 00:07:53.175
that existed at that time?

00:07:53.175 --> 00:07:54.753
When they looked at the exams

00:07:54.753 --> 00:07:57.900
that the state of Ohio gave in 1990,

00:07:57.900 --> 00:08:00.286
they were all about abstractions.